{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/9c36bf648fe0349447a5600f8539cd04.avif?t=1768216964\" width=1560 height=132 /></span><strong>Farmers Market\u00a0</strong>\u2014 a cozy farming game where you play the market\u00a0<strong> \ud83c\udf31\ud83d\udcc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow crops, react to town events, and sell at just the right moment to feed your village.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crops grow calmly \u2014 prices change every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/3277c3b9a35b2399bdc9d8230cc6d375.avif?t=1768216964\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s the twist?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village market has fallen apart, shelves are empty, prices swing wildly, and people are going hungry.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re given a small patch of land and a handful of seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success comes from watching prices, reacting to town events, and selling at the right moment not from endless grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/7727944d8abdedc040b2c55950c68e17.avif?t=1768216964\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market-driven farming: supply, demand, and season push prices up and down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple trend tools: arrows + charts help you decide when to sell\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town events matter: sudden demand spikes (chef visits, weddings, festivals\u2026)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your impact is visible: track progress with the <strong>People Nourished</strong> counter\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ crops with seasonal bonuses\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens, cows, and pigs producing goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy upgrades + quests (nothing punishing, no fail states)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/6795c1ee53eb3b740d6675a91cb1c47d.avif?t=1768216964\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/eaab907ecb1154302da6b018716ef3e2.avif?t=1768216964\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No stress design:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crops never die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prices always recover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time moves at your pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/bdf7feb3a2922d20518451042fd3e38b.avif?t=1768216964\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist reminder\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this looks interesting to you please Wishlist \u2014 it\u2019s the #1 thing that helps me keep building it and reach more cozy players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae STEAM DECK SUPPORT This game is fully playable on Steam Deck with native touch controls! Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Touch screen 